SelectDirLabel=Select the folder where you would like {0} to be installed, then click Next.  ${compiler:sys.newLine}${compiler:sys.newLine}If you later want to convert jAER to a .git updateable version, choose a folder that you have rights to modify as a user.
FinishedLabel=Setup has finished installing {0} on your computer. jAER may be launched by the installed icon or by launching the executable ${compiler:sys.shortName} in the installation folder ${installer:sys.installationDir}.
UninstalledAll={0} was successfully removed from your computer. ${compiler:sys.newLine}${compiler:sys.newLine}Sample recordings in jaer/sampleData (including files you added there) were deleted. Recordings stored elsewhere, such as jaerSampleData in your home folder, were not removed. ${compiler:sys.newLine}${compiler:sys.newLine}If files remain in ${installer:sys.installationDir}, that folder will open so you can inspect them.
